{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">俄羅斯襲擊烏克蘭多處地點，共造成最少25人死亡，大約100人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">俄軍周二晚開始，通宵以70枚導彈和幾十架無人機，襲擊烏克蘭10多個州，其中於切爾尼戈夫州普里盧基市，有一幢5層高住宅大樓被炸毀，有15人死亡，包括5名小童，大約50人受傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.UKR.RUSSIA 0230 UP 0320_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hKMwN6nvAw1791416616.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.UKR.RUSSIA 0230 UP 0320_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">烏克蘭空軍表示，俄軍46架噴射引擎無人機當中，有稍多於八成被擊落。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">總統澤連斯基表示，俄軍摧毀普里盧基市那幢住宅大樓，來慶祝總統普京74歲生日。澤連斯基周二已警告國民，俄方正準備向烏克蘭發動大規模襲擊。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.UKR.RUSSIA 0230 UP 0320_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026G8WKGxZBUW1791416632.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.UKR.RUSSIA 0230 UP 0320_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T00:39:51.906702+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}